      "message": "test(ui): accept Zigzag rest pockets in the rest group refusal test\n\nPR #2037 made Zigzag legal for 2D rest machining (closing boundary\npasses, #1490). The UI test from #1815 still expected the old Zigzag\nrefusal and turned main red. The test now asserts that Zigzag with rest\ncommits on Apply, and keeps the refusal asserts for Adaptive and for\npre-drilled entry.\n\nFixes #2302\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
